<!-- Generated by contextmux from .ctxmux/ — do not edit by hand. ctxmux:hash=b4ca43e2f5e7 -->

`pnpm build` is tsup, and owns `dist/`. `pnpm typecheck` is a single `tsc --noEmit` from the
root that resolves workspace imports to source. **Do not point them at the same directory.**
They shared `dist/` once: whichever ran last won, and the published bundle could come out
incomplete. Tests resolve to source too, so typecheck checks what the tests run.
